---
title: "enter_market (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: ensure_version_matches()
    q_validate --> q_validate_market: validate_market(market)
    q_validate_market --> q_check_emode: assert_emode_group_exists(emode_group)
    q_check_emode --> q_check_circuit: assert !circuit_break_triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_create: new Obligation(market_id, emode_group)
    q_create --> q_register: market.handle_new_obligation(obligation)
    q_register --> q_emit: emit ObligationCreatedEvent
    q_emit --> q_transfer: transfer obligation_cap to sender
    q_transfer --> [*]

    note right of q_create
        INV-001: Obligation emode_group is immutable after creation
        INV-002: obligation_cap.obligation_id matches obligation object ID
        INV-003: emode_group must exist in EModeGroupRegistry
    end note
